        "purpose": "Plain markdown text of one comment. Agents and humans may write comments. A comment is feedback on exactly one paragraph (linked by comments-on) and never edits it. Authorship is the engine-stamped createdBy (RFC-046); never write an author here."
      },
      "createdAt": "2026-10-02T21:40:51.924525593+00:00",
