        "purpose": "Editor state, one record per essay: which members the editor hides or folds, which container holds the draft paragraphs, and which container is the Bin (paragraphs deleted from the essay; deleting from the Bin is permanent). Hide/fold, drafts and the bin are editor mechanics, not document meaning, so spec renderers and compositions ignore this type. Do not use it to carry content."
